{
  "units": [
    {
      "id": 0,
      "paragraph": 1,
      "en": "Visitors to the Westford Museum",
      "he": "מבקרים במוזיאון וסטפורד",
      "start_word": 0,
      "end_word": 4
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "paragraph": 1,
      "en": "usually expect to see objects behind glass.",
      "he": "בדרך כלל מצפים לראות חפצים מאחורי זכוכית.",
      "start_word": 5,
      "end_word": 11
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "paragraph": 1,
      "en": "Last summer, however,",
      "he": "אולם בקיץ שעבר,",
      "start_word": 12,
      "end_word": 14
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "paragraph": 1,
      "en": "they found an empty display case near the entrance.",
      "he": "הם מצאו ארון תצוגה ריק ליד הכניסה.",
      "start_word": 15,
      "end_word": 23
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "paragraph": 1,
      "en": "Nothing had been stolen,",
      "he": "שום דבר לא נגנב,",
      "start_word": 24,
      "end_word": 27
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "paragraph": 1,
      "en": "and the museum had not run out of things to show.",
      "he": "ולמוזיאון לא אזלו החפצים להצגה.",
      "start_word": 28,
      "end_word": 38
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "paragraph": 1,
      "en": "Instead,",
      "he": "במקום זאת,",
      "start_word": 39,
      "end_word": 39
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "paragraph": 1,
      "en": "the empty space was an invitation.",
      "he": "החלל הריק היה הזמנה.",
      "start_word": 40,
      "end_word": 45
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "paragraph": 1,
      "en": "The museum wanted local residents",
      "he": "המוזיאון רצה שתושבי המקום",
      "start_word": 46,
      "end_word": 50
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "paragraph": 1,
      "en": "to suggest an everyday object",
      "he": "יציעו חפץ מחיי היום־יום",
      "start_word": 51,
      "end_word": 55
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "paragraph": 1,
      "en": "for a new exhibition about life in the town.",
      "he": "לתערוכה חדשה על החיים בעיירה.",
      "start_word": 56,
      "end_word": 64
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "paragraph": 1,
      "en": "Its aim was to include experiences",
      "he": "מטרתו הייתה לכלול חוויות",
      "start_word": 65,
      "end_word": 70
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "paragraph": 1,
      "en": "that were missing from its existing collections.",
      "he": "שהיו חסרות באוספים הקיימים שלו.",
      "start_word": 71,
      "end_word": 77
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "paragraph": 2,
      "en": "Residents could suggest anything",
      "he": "התושבים יכלו להציע כל דבר",
      "start_word": 78,
      "end_word": 81
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "paragraph": 2,
      "en": "from a kitchen tool to a bus ticket.",
      "he": "מכלי מטבח ועד כרטיס אוטובוס.",
      "start_word": 82,
      "end_word": 89
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "paragraph": 2,
      "en": "They first had to send a photograph",
      "he": "תחילה היה עליהם לשלוח תמונה",
      "start_word": 90,
      "end_word": 96
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "paragraph": 2,
      "en": "and a short description",
      "he": "ותיאור קצר",
      "start_word": 97,
      "end_word": 100
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "paragraph": 2,
      "en": "explaining where the object came from",
      "he": "המסביר מאין הגיע החפץ",
      "start_word": 101,
      "end_word": 106
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "paragraph": 2,
      "en": "and why it mattered to them.",
      "he": "ולמה הוא היה חשוב להם.",
      "start_word": 107,
      "end_word": 112
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "paragraph": 2,
      "en": "These details helped the museum team",
      "he": "פרטים אלה עזרו לצוות המוזיאון",
      "start_word": 113,
      "end_word": 118
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "paragraph": 2,
      "en": "understand the story behind each suggestion.",
      "he": "להבין את הסיפור מאחורי כל הצעה.",
      "start_word": 119,
      "end_word": 124
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "paragraph": 2,
      "en": "People did not need to bring the object to the museum",
      "he": "האנשים לא נדרשו להביא את החפץ למוזיאון",
      "start_word": 125,
      "end_word": 135
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "paragraph": 2,
      "en": "unless the team contacted them.",
      "he": "אלא אם הצוות פנה אליהם.",
      "start_word": 136,
      "end_word": 140
    },
    {
      "id": 23,
      "paragraph": 2,
      "en": "This made it possible to consider objects",
      "he": "כך היה אפשר לשקול גם חפצים",
      "start_word": 141,
      "end_word": 147
    },
    {
      "id": 24,
      "paragraph": 2,
      "en": "that were still being used at home.",
      "he": "שעדיין השתמשו בהם בבית.",
      "start_word": 148,
      "end_word": 154
    },
    {
      "id": 25,
      "paragraph": 3,
      "en": "Choosing an object was more difficult",
      "he": "בחירת חפץ הייתה קשה יותר",
      "start_word": 155,
      "end_word": 160
    },
    {
      "id": 26,
      "paragraph": 3,
      "en": "than the team had expected.",
      "he": "מכפי שהצוות ציפה.",
      "start_word": 161,
      "end_word": 165
    },
    {
      "id": 27,
      "paragraph": 3,
      "en": "Some residents assumed",
      "he": "כמה תושבים הניחו",
      "start_word": 166,
      "end_word": 168
    },
    {
      "id": 28,
      "paragraph": 3,
      "en": "that the oldest or most expensive item would win.",
      "he": "שהפריט העתיק ביותר או היקר ביותר ייבחר.",
      "start_word": 169,
      "end_word": 177
    },
    {
      "id": 29,
      "paragraph": 3,
      "en": "However, the team was looking for something",
      "he": "אולם הצוות חיפש משהו",
      "start_word": 178,
      "end_word": 184
    },
    {
      "id": 30,
      "paragraph": 3,
      "en": "that could reveal an interesting part of everyday life.",
      "he": "שיוכל לחשוף היבט מעניין של חיי היום־יום.",
      "start_word": 185,
      "end_word": 193
    },
    {
      "id": 31,
      "paragraph": 3,
      "en": "A beautiful silver watch was not selected",
      "he": "שעון כסף יפה לא נבחר",
      "start_word": 194,
      "end_word": 200
    },
    {
      "id": 32,
      "paragraph": 3,
      "en": "because very little was known about its owner.",
      "he": "מפני שהיה ידוע מעט מאוד על בעליו.",
      "start_word": 201,
      "end_word": 208
    },
    {
      "id": 33,
      "paragraph": 3,
      "en": "A worn school bag attracted more attention",
      "he": "תיק בית ספר בלוי משך תשומת לב רבה יותר",
      "start_word": 209,
      "end_word": 215
    },
    {
      "id": 34,
      "paragraph": 3,
      "en": "because it had belonged to three generations of the same family,",
      "he": "מפני שהיה שייך לשלושה דורות של אותה משפחה,",
      "start_word": 216,
      "end_word": 226
    },
    {
      "id": 35,
      "paragraph": 3,
      "en": "who had all attended the local school.",
      "he": "שכולם למדו בבית הספר המקומי.",
      "start_word": 227,
      "end_word": 233
    },
    {
      "id": 36,
      "paragraph": 4,
      "en": "Sixteen-year-old Daniel suggested the bag",
      "he": "דניאל בן השש־עשרה הציע את התיק",
      "start_word": 234,
      "end_word": 238
    },
    {
      "id": 37,
      "paragraph": 4,
      "en": "after finding it in his grandmother's cupboard.",
      "he": "לאחר שמצא אותו בארון של סבתו.",
      "start_word": 239,
      "end_word": 245
    },
    {
      "id": 38,
      "paragraph": 4,
      "en": "He originally hoped",
      "he": "בתחילה הוא קיווה",
      "start_word": 246,
      "end_word": 248
    },
    {
      "id": 39,
      "paragraph": 4,
      "en": "that the museum would help him discover",
      "he": "שהמוזיאון יעזור לו לגלות",
      "start_word": 249,
      "end_word": 255
    },
    {
      "id": 40,
      "paragraph": 4,
      "en": "when it had been made.",
      "he": "מתי התיק יוצר.",
      "start_word": 256,
      "end_word": 260
    },
    {
      "id": 41,
      "paragraph": 4,
      "en": "While preparing his description, however,",
      "he": "אולם בזמן שהכין את התיאור שלו,",
      "start_word": 261,
      "end_word": 265
    },
    {
      "id": 42,
      "paragraph": 4,
      "en": "he interviewed several relatives",
      "he": "הוא ראיין כמה קרובי משפחה",
      "start_word": 266,
      "end_word": 269
    },
    {
      "id": 43,
      "paragraph": 4,
      "en": "and learned about their school days.",
      "he": "ולמד על שנות הלימודים שלהם.",
      "start_word": 270,
      "end_word": 275
    },
    {
      "id": 44,
      "paragraph": 4,
      "en": "The museum could not establish the bag's exact age,",
      "he": "המוזיאון לא הצליח לקבוע את גילו המדויק של התיק,",
      "start_word": 276,
      "end_word": 284
    },
    {
      "id": 45,
      "paragraph": 4,
      "en": "but Daniel felt that the conversations had been worthwhile.",
      "he": "אבל דניאל הרגיש שהשיחות היו שוות את המאמץ.",
      "start_word": 285,
      "end_word": 293
    },
    {
      "id": 46,
      "paragraph": 4,
      "en": "He had discovered",
      "he": "הוא גילה",
      "start_word": 294,
      "end_word": 296
    },
    {
      "id": 47,
      "paragraph": 4,
      "en": "that an ordinary object could encourage people to share memories",
      "he": "שחפץ רגיל יכול לעודד אנשים לשתף זיכרונות",
      "start_word": 297,
      "end_word": 306
    },
    {
      "id": 48,
      "paragraph": 4,
      "en": "they had never discussed with him before.",
      "he": "שמעולם לא סיפרו לו עליהם קודם.",
      "start_word": 307,
      "end_word": 313
    },
    {
      "id": 49,
      "paragraph": 5,
      "en": "The bag was eventually chosen,",
      "he": "בסופו של דבר התיק נבחר,",
      "start_word": 314,
      "end_word": 318
    },
    {
      "id": 50,
      "paragraph": 5,
      "en": "together with photographs and memories",
      "he": "יחד עם תמונות וזיכרונות",
      "start_word": 319,
      "end_word": 323
    },
    {
      "id": 51,
      "paragraph": 5,
      "en": "provided by Daniel's family.",
      "he": "שמסרה משפחתו של דניאל.",
      "start_word": 324,
      "end_word": 327
    },
    {
      "id": 52,
      "paragraph": 5,
      "en": "Nevertheless, the museum team recognized a limitation:",
      "he": "למרות זאת, צוות המוזיאון זיהה מגבלה:",
      "start_word": 328,
      "end_word": 334
    },
    {
      "id": 53,
      "paragraph": 5,
      "en": "one family's experience could not represent everyone in Westford.",
      "he": "החוויה של משפחה אחת לא יכלה לייצג את כל תושבי וסטפורד.",
      "start_word": 335,
      "end_word": 343
    },
    {
      "id": 54,
      "paragraph": 5,
      "en": "They therefore invited visitors",
      "he": "לכן הם הזמינו את המבקרים",
      "start_word": 344,
      "end_word": 347
    },
    {
      "id": 55,
      "paragraph": 5,
      "en": "to add their own school memories",
      "he": "להוסיף את הזיכרונות שלהם מבית הספר",
      "start_word": 348,
      "end_word": 353
    },
    {
      "id": 56,
      "paragraph": 5,
      "en": "to a noticeboard beside the display.",
      "he": "ללוח מודעות לצד התצוגה.",
      "start_word": 354,
      "end_word": 359
    },
    {
      "id": 57,
      "paragraph": 5,
      "en": "The team is also considering a similar exhibition",
      "he": "הצוות שוקל גם תערוכה דומה",
      "start_word": 360,
      "end_word": 367
    },
    {
      "id": 58,
      "paragraph": 5,
      "en": "about working life.",
      "he": "על חיי העבודה.",
      "start_word": 368,
      "end_word": 370
    },
    {
      "id": 59,
      "paragraph": 5,
      "en": "No date has been set,",
      "he": "טרם נקבע מועד,",
      "start_word": 371,
      "end_word": 375
    },
    {
      "id": 60,
      "paragraph": 5,
      "en": "since staff must first review",
      "he": "מפני שהצוות צריך תחילה לבחון",
      "start_word": 376,
      "end_word": 380
    },
    {
      "id": 61,
      "paragraph": 5,
      "en": "what they learned from the school exhibition.",
      "he": "מה למד מתערוכת בית הספר.",
      "start_word": 381,
      "end_word": 387
    }
  ],
